Feature: Rewind
  Backspace takes the flight back 10 seconds, and you fly on from there: a crash is undone,
  and so is a bad turn. The sim keeps the last ten minutes, and it never goes back past the
  start of the flight. With ArduPilot the sim can't rewind yet, and the HUD says so.

  Expectation: Backspace undoes a crash
    A crash a few seconds after the throw goes back to the moment before the throw: the plane
    is in your hand again.
    Given the plane is crashed
    And the throttle is 0 %
    When the pilot rewinds
    Then the plane is in hand
